							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Bay Area Street Team went crazy up in Berkeley, Chris, Jose, Curtis, and Adrian Represent. We hit up all the local record stores including Rasputin and Amoeba&#039;s and put up posters and stickers wherever possible. Also put up stickers and posters all over UC Berkeley and pretty much all streets surrounding it. Bill boards, street signs, phone booths, news stands, doors. <br /><br />Here the pictures:<br /><br />Billboard<br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0559.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0560.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0561.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Inside Amoeba Records<br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0562.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0563.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0564.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0565.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0570.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0571.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0572.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0574.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0575.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0576.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/defyantx07/IMG_0577.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Street stands and signs<br /><img src="http://i10.photobucket.com/albums/a139/d